flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> RoleSelect[Splash / Role Select Screen]

    RoleSelect -->|Reader| ReaderLogin[Reader Login Screen]
    RoleSelect -->|Staff| StaffLogin[Staff Login Screen]

    ReaderLogin <-->|Switch portal| StaffLogin

    %% ==========================================
    %% AUTH FLOW - READER
    %% ==========================================
    ReaderLogin -->|No account| Register[Register Screen]
    ReaderLogin -->|Forgot password| ForgotPwdReader[Reader Forgot Password Screen]
    ReaderLogin -->|Login success| ReaderHome([Reader Home Screen])

    Register -->|Submit form| VerifyRegister[Verify OTP / Email Screen]
    VerifyRegister -->|Success| RegSuccess[Registration Success Screen]
    RegSuccess --> ReaderLogin
    Register -->|Already have account| ReaderLogin

    ForgotPwdReader -->|Enter email or phone| OtpReader[Verify OTP Screen]
    OtpReader -->|Valid OTP| ResetPwdReader[Reset Password Screen]
    ResetPwdReader -->|Success| ReaderLogin
    ForgotPwdReader -->|Back| ReaderLogin

    %% ==========================================
    %% AUTH FLOW - STAFF / ADMIN / DEVICE
    %% ==========================================
    StaffLogin -->|Forgot password| ForgotPwdStaff[Staff Forgot Password Screen]
    StaffLogin -->|Login: role=staff| StaffHome([Staff Home / Quầy nghiệp vụ])
    StaffLogin -->|Login: role=admin| AdminHome([Admin Home / Quản trị viên])
    StaffLogin -->|Login: role=device| DeviceHome([Device Home / Trạm Kiosk])

    ForgotPwdStaff -->|Enter internal email| OtpStaff[Verify OTP Screen]
    OtpStaff -->|Valid OTP| ResetPwdStaff[Reset Password Screen]
    ResetPwdStaff -->|Success| StaffLogin
    ForgotPwdStaff -->|Back| StaffLogin

    %% ==========================================
    %% READER FLOW
    %% ==========================================
    ReaderHome -->|View & edit profile| ReaderProfile[Reader Profile Screen]
    ReaderProfile -->|Save success| ReaderProfile

    %% ==========================================
    %% STAFF FLOW
    %% ==========================================
    StaffHome -->|View & edit profile| StaffProfile[Staff Profile Screen]
    StaffProfile -->|Save success| StaffProfile

    StaffHome -->|Manage readers| ReaderList[Reader List Screen]
    ReaderList -->|Select reader| ReaderDetail[Reader Detail Screen]
    ReaderDetail -->|Edit| ReaderEditModal[Reader Edit Modal / Screen]
    ReaderEditModal -->|Save success| ReaderDetail

    %% ==========================================
    %% ADMIN FLOW
    %% ==========================================
    AdminHome -->|Manage staff| StaffList[Staff List Screen]
    AdminHome -->|Manage readers| ReaderList
    AdminHome -->|Device monitor| DeviceMonitor[Device / Kiosk Monitor]
    AdminHome -->|Operation stats| OpsReport[Operation Report & Stats]

    %% ==========================================
    %% DEVICE FLOW - SELF SERVICE KIOSK
    %% ==========================================
    DeviceHome -->|Scan card| SelfCheckout[Self Checkout & Return]
    DeviceHome -->|Check hardware| HardwareStatus[Scanner / Hardware Status]
    DeviceHome -->|Lock station| RoleSelect

    StaffList -->|Add staff| CreateStaff[Create Staff Screen]
    CreateStaff -->|Create success| StaffList

    StaffList -->|Select staff| StaffDetail[Staff Detail Screen]
    StaffDetail -->|Edit name| StaffEditModal[Staff Edit Modal]
    StaffEditModal -->|Save success| StaffDetail

    StaffDetail -->|Assign role| AssignRoleDialog[Assign Role Dialog]
    AssignRoleDialog -->|Assign success| StaffDetail
